WEBVTT

00:02.880 --> 00:04.710
You still haven't handed those over?

00:05.000 --> 00:08.000
The 14th was a Sunday, y'know?

00:08.000 --> 00:10.330
I-it's not like this is anything great.

00:10.330 --> 00:12.830
But, she gave me some chocolate.

00:12.830 --> 00:16.290
So I got some cookies from like
a random corner store or whatever.

00:16.290 --> 00:17.460
"Or whatever...?"

00:17.460 --> 00:19.290
Quit trying to play it down.

00:19.630 --> 00:21.630
Look at that perfect wrapping paper.

00:21.630 --> 00:23.000
It's not like that!

00:23.250 --> 00:26.920
My sights are still set on Yamada.

00:27.170 --> 00:30.250
This is just a little token of thanks for Sekine.

00:30.250 --> 00:33.670
Thanks for what?
You only got what everyone else did.

00:33.830 --> 00:37.210
Nuh-uh! Mine had a heart in it.

00:37.750 --> 00:40.460
Absolutely a sign it was special!

00:41.130 --> 00:42.790
So what's your plan?

00:42.790 --> 00:47.710
I'm gonna go casually toss
these cookies in her shoe box.

00:47.710 --> 00:50.960
And since you'll just happen to see it,
you're gonna tell Sekine.

00:51.380 --> 00:52.540
Those are from Adachi.

00:52.540 --> 00:53.710
He put them in there.

00:54.210 --> 00:55.830
Adachi...

00:57.040 --> 00:57.880
Like that!

00:57.880 --> 00:58.790
Like hell!

00:58.790 --> 01:01.210
It's still the plan. Here goes!

01:06.420 --> 01:08.170
This is ridiculous.

01:08.790 --> 01:09.960
Okay, Sekine's box is...

01:09.960 --> 01:11.000
You really don't know a thing, do you, Anna?
Okay, Sekine's box is...<b></b>

01:11.000 --> 01:12.040
You really don't know a thing, do you, Anna?

01:12.040 --> 01:13.880
What? Says who?
Ack! Shoot!<b></b>

01:17.960 --> 01:18.710
What's that...?

01:18.710 --> 01:22.920
Ack! Crap! I thew it in Yamada's, not Sekine's...

01:23.080 --> 01:25.580
Look, there's a letter, too.

01:25.580 --> 01:28.290
No, uhh, it's not... You see...

01:28.290 --> 01:30.880
Hmm, right.

01:31.210 --> 01:33.750
I'm just gonna head on home, then.

01:33.750 --> 01:34.710
Wait!

01:39.380 --> 01:42.210
No, listen. Uhh...

01:42.460 --> 01:45.330
Yeah, yeah. Enough already.
Stop! Let me go!<b></b>

01:45.960 --> 01:48.330
You're gonna go in there and say thank you.

01:48.330 --> 01:50.790
I'm not letting my cookies go to waste.

01:50.790 --> 01:52.290
It's Adachi's mom...

01:52.290 --> 01:53.290
Go on, then.

01:56.460 --> 01:57.500
What?

01:57.790 --> 02:01.330
So uhhh, that chocolate was really good!

02:01.330 --> 02:05.080
It was all handmade and I really liked it and...

02:05.290 --> 02:07.170
That was real nice, y'know!

02:07.170 --> 02:10.670
Did you forget the part where everyone got some?

02:10.670 --> 02:12.000
Yeah, but!

02:15.710 --> 02:16.750
There you go.

02:17.130 --> 02:18.250
Later...

02:18.250 --> 02:19.250
Yeah...

02:19.630 --> 02:21.540
Attaboy! You did it!

02:21.540 --> 02:23.000
Cut it out...

02:23.330 --> 02:25.540
She smelled really nice.

02:25.540 --> 02:28.000
Huh? Oh, yeah...

02:28.420 --> 02:29.380
Here.

02:29.920 --> 02:33.960
Shoot, I didn't tell her those aren't from me.

02:35.290 --> 02:36.630
Let's see what it says.

02:41.420 --> 02:43.250
Dear lovers!

02:41.420 --> 02:49.250
<b>Chocolate was totes amazing.</b>

02:41.420 --> 02:49.250
<b>Super thanks!</b>

02:41.420 --> 02:49.250
<b>Hope we can</b>

02:41.420 --> 02:49.250
<b>keep being lovey-dovey my lovey!</b>

02:41.420 --> 02:49.250
<b>Kiss kiss kiss</b>

02:43.250 --> 02:46.500
Chocolate was totes amazing. Super thanks!

02:46.500 --> 02:49.250
Hope we can keep being lovey-dovey my lovey!
Kiss kiss kiss!

04:23.330 --> 04:25.580
<b>March 24th</b>

04:24.670 --> 04:27.880
Today we say farewell to this classroom, too.

04:25.580 --> 04:30.540
<b>Year-end Ceremony</b>

04:27.880 --> 04:30.330
It's the last time we'll all be together in the same class.

04:30.710 --> 04:32.710
We've had ups and downs,
Hey, they split up groups of friends<b></b>

04:32.710 --> 04:35.210
but I enjoyed being your teacher.
when we change classes, right?<b></b>

04:35.210 --> 04:36.830
but I enjoyed being your teacher.
So I hear.<b></b>

04:37.000 --> 04:39.250
Well I've got a plan...

04:40.250 --> 04:41.750
Idiots! Morons!

04:41.750 --> 04:44.750
I've always hated the both of you!

04:44.750 --> 04:46.080
Huh? What's going on?

04:46.080 --> 04:51.250
Mr. Maeda! I was never friends or anything with them!

04:51.250 --> 04:53.920
I'm glad I'm getting split from them next year!

04:54.630 --> 04:56.130
And from Yamada!

04:57.630 --> 04:59.250
Y-Yamada?

04:59.250 --> 05:01.380
Wait, we talked about this!

05:01.380 --> 05:02.710
Anyway!

05:02.710 --> 05:05.880
Please keep me out of the same class as them!

05:05.880 --> 05:08.130
Oh, really? Okay then.

05:08.130 --> 05:09.170
What?!

05:09.670 --> 05:11.290
Wait, no...

05:11.290 --> 05:13.000
BayashiKo!

05:13.330 --> 05:16.420
We live in the tiniest of bubbles.

05:17.250 --> 05:19.830
Ichikawa, gimme your Line ID.

05:19.830 --> 05:20.960
Me too!

05:20.960 --> 05:22.830
And me, too.

05:26.380 --> 05:28.670
A tiny bubble we call the classroom.

05:45.000 --> 05:47.250
<b>Anna Yamada</b>

05:45.000 --> 05:47.250
<b>You still at school?</b>

05:52.670 --> 05:54.460
We aren't allowed to play in here.

05:55.710 --> 05:56.920
No one's gotta know.

05:58.460 --> 06:00.540
I just kinda wanted to stick around.

06:00.540 --> 06:02.880
You too, I take it?

06:02.880 --> 06:05.250
Me? Not really.

06:05.250 --> 06:06.580
Okay!

06:07.040 --> 06:08.290
Let's play one-on-one!

06:08.290 --> 06:09.040
Seriously?

06:09.040 --> 06:10.330
Whoever loses...

06:10.330 --> 06:13.460
...has to do whatever the winner wishes.

06:14.380 --> 06:15.630
That wasn't fair!

06:39.380 --> 06:40.880
You're not much of a shot.

06:40.880 --> 06:43.170
I'm better on defense!

06:51.580 --> 06:53.170
If I get this in...

07:01.460 --> 07:03.210
ACK! Sorry!

07:09.540 --> 07:10.790
If I get this in...

07:15.170 --> 07:16.460
If I get this in...

07:17.670 --> 07:18.920
...I'm gonna...

07:19.710 --> 07:20.830
...ask her out!

07:32.500 --> 07:33.790
No such luck.

07:41.290 --> 07:41.960
Yay!

07:41.960 --> 07:43.420
What? That was my basket.

07:43.420 --> 07:47.750
Too bad! I put it in, so I win!

07:48.420 --> 07:50.670
Let's just say that didn't count, then.

07:50.670 --> 07:53.040
You really like basketball, huh?

07:54.710 --> 07:57.080
Only because you're playing with me.

07:57.330 --> 07:58.170
Huh?

08:00.960 --> 08:03.830
Now what should I ask for?

08:06.920 --> 08:07.790
Can...

08:08.250 --> 08:09.130
Hmm?

08:09.920 --> 08:10.880
Can...

08:13.920 --> 08:15.210
Can I...

08:19.040 --> 08:22.830
Can I... call you "Kyo?"

08:23.250 --> 08:24.040
Wha?!

08:25.630 --> 08:27.380
Y-yeah, I mean—

08:27.380 --> 08:28.290
Hey!

08:28.830 --> 08:30.290
Hurry up and get on home.

08:33.750 --> 08:35.250
<b>Kyo</b>

08:33.750 --> 08:35.250
<b>Why'd you leave without me?</b>

08:35.250 --> 08:36.500
<b>Kobayashi's plan</b>

08:36.880 --> 08:37.750
<b>ohhh</b>

08:37.750 --> 08:39.500
<b>hmm?</b>

08:39.500 --> 08:40.790
<b>hoping we're in the same class</b>

08:41.210 --> 08:42.540
<b>you mean?</b>

08:42.540 --> 08:44.130
<b>hoping we're in the same class</b>

08:42.540 --> 08:44.130
<b>you mean?</b>

08:47.880 --> 08:49.210
"Kyo..."

08:50.040 --> 08:51.830
What do you think, Kyo?

08:52.580 --> 08:54.290
Hey, Kyo.

08:54.830 --> 08:55.920
Kyo...

08:56.500 --> 08:57.790
Kyo!

08:59.790 --> 09:01.540
Go on and call her Anna, then.

09:02.290 --> 09:03.580
W-who are you?!

09:03.580 --> 09:05.630
I'm Lucifer Nigorikawa.

09:05.630 --> 09:08.330
Your natural instinct. Your libido.

09:08.330 --> 09:09.750
Again, who?

09:10.000 --> 09:12.960
I'm what grows massive when
your feelings get you all turned on!

09:13.670 --> 09:15.130
Hey, Kyo-chan.

09:15.130 --> 09:15.920
What?

09:16.580 --> 09:18.380
Don't just burst in here without knocking.

09:18.380 --> 09:22.040
Mom says she's gonna make sukiyaki
for your birthday the day after tomorrow.

09:22.790 --> 09:24.290
It's gonna be a party!

09:24.290 --> 09:27.250
Like we ever have a party.

09:27.500 --> 09:32.250
Oh come on.
This year isn't like all the rest.

09:35.630 --> 09:37.540
Are you going out somewhere?

09:37.540 --> 09:38.790
No...

09:38.790 --> 09:42.500
Yamada's busy with work over break
and I have cram school...

09:42.500 --> 09:43.750
What's that?

09:44.080 --> 09:48.080
When did I even mention little Anna, hmm?

09:48.750 --> 09:51.380
Oh shut up! Get outta my room!

09:54.960 --> 09:58.170
A whole lot of nothing happened,
and my birthday was here.

09:59.080 --> 10:00.790
Same as always, really.

10:03.960 --> 10:05.130
<b>cherry blossoms at night!</b>

10:08.290 --> 10:11.830
<b>you out now?</b>

10:12.040 --> 10:13.500
It's a special day...

10:12.040 --> 10:13.500
<b>on the train</b>

10:14.630 --> 10:15.670
Maybe I can...

10:14.630 --> 10:15.670
<b>finished work</b>

10:15.670 --> 10:16.880
<b>Me too</b>

10:15.670 --> 10:16.880
<b>At the station now</b>

10:27.630 --> 10:28.710
Powee!

10:29.250 --> 10:31.130
You always walk home alone?

10:31.130 --> 10:34.670
Yeah, except when it's really late.

10:34.960 --> 10:36.500
That's pretty dangerous.

10:36.500 --> 10:38.290
For you too, Ichikawa!

10:38.290 --> 10:39.710
You walk home alone, right?

10:39.710 --> 10:41.420
Yeah, but that's ME...

10:41.420 --> 10:42.210
Hmm?

10:42.540 --> 10:43.710
"Ichikawa?"

10:44.130 --> 10:47.830
Can I...call you "Kyo?"

10:47.830 --> 10:50.380
Did I mishear her or something?

10:51.210 --> 10:55.080
Or does she think me leaving early
meant I don't want her to?

10:55.420 --> 10:56.630
Maybe I should...

10:57.000 --> 10:59.210
Sure thing. Call me Kyo!

10:59.500 --> 11:02.380
Not happening! That'd be so weird!

11:03.210 --> 11:06.540
What's going on? I feel like I'm being watched.

11:10.210 --> 11:12.880
Is someone following us?

11:15.420 --> 11:16.540
They're getting close.

11:17.250 --> 11:18.380
No way...

11:19.210 --> 11:20.290
What do I do?

11:20.830 --> 11:21.790
What—

11:25.130 --> 11:26.920
I gotta protect her with my life!

11:27.710 --> 11:29.040
Keep her safe!

11:31.210 --> 11:33.250
Thought that was you, Kyo-chan.

11:34.500 --> 11:37.000
Dad... You scared me to death!

11:37.000 --> 11:39.880
Sorry. Wasn't sure you'd want me to butt in.

11:39.880 --> 11:41.830
Huh? Ah!

11:42.790 --> 11:44.500
G-good evening!

11:44.750 --> 11:46.500
Sorry for spooking you.

11:46.500 --> 11:49.540
I was just out picking up the cake we ordered.

11:49.540 --> 11:52.710
Cake? Are you celebrating something?

11:52.710 --> 11:55.540
Yeah, his birthday.

11:57.710 --> 12:01.540
W-what?! Today? Why didn't you tell me?

12:01.540 --> 12:04.130
We're having Matsusaka beef sukiyaki...

12:06.040 --> 12:08.710
Wanna come over for a bit?

12:13.670 --> 12:14.670
Yeah!

12:15.250 --> 12:16.170
What...?

12:18.580 --> 12:21.460
This is gonna be a CELEBRATION!

12:24.920 --> 12:27.330
Yeah, so I won't need dinner.

12:27.330 --> 12:29.960
That's fine, but whose house?

12:29.960 --> 12:32.540
Oh, umm...

12:32.790 --> 12:34.250
Anna-chan!

12:34.540 --> 12:36.080
Oh, a girl?

12:36.960 --> 12:39.170
Yeah, Kana-chan.

12:39.170 --> 12:39.920
Is that so?

12:39.920 --> 12:41.210
Gotta go now.

12:42.580 --> 12:44.580
What did you get changed for?

12:44.580 --> 12:46.130
This is just party-wear.

12:46.130 --> 12:47.540
You look adorable!

12:50.420 --> 12:52.210
Come on, smile!

12:52.580 --> 12:54.000
Quit torturing me.

12:54.880 --> 12:57.790
Happy birthday, Kyo...

12:57.920 --> 13:00.420
<b>Note: Ichikawa mishears "Kyo" as "kyou,"</b>

12:57.920 --> 13:00.420
<b>the Japanese word for "today."</b>

12:58.460 --> 12:59.630
"Today?"

13:00.830 --> 13:03.130
Oh right, sorry.

13:03.130 --> 13:05.460
Here. Eat as much as you like.

13:05.460 --> 13:08.880
D-don't worry. I don't need much.

13:09.290 --> 13:11.460
I-I'm a light eater...

13:11.460 --> 13:13.250
The biggest lie there ever was.

13:13.460 --> 13:17.250
Explains why you're so skinny.
I'm almost worried!

13:17.250 --> 13:19.710
Yeah, you look like a model.

13:21.080 --> 13:23.670
Yeah. I am.

13:24.290 --> 13:25.210
What?

13:25.210 --> 13:28.080
You're really a model? Like in amateur zines?

13:28.080 --> 13:32.460
No, just a regular one. In an agency and everything.

13:32.460 --> 13:33.960
She's a professional fashion model.

13:33.960 --> 13:35.080
"Professional?"

13:38.830 --> 13:42.290
What was I thinking dressing like this?

13:42.290 --> 13:43.330
I know that feeling.

13:43.790 --> 13:45.920
Kana, there's still more beer.

13:45.920 --> 13:47.630
Oh, let me get that for you!

13:48.460 --> 13:50.330
A drink from a model...

13:50.330 --> 13:51.080
Chill out.

13:51.830 --> 13:53.460
H-how about you, sir?

13:53.460 --> 13:55.040
I'm drinking tea.

13:56.170 --> 13:59.750
Kana, didn't you go get him a present?

13:59.750 --> 14:02.250
What? Oh, that can wait...

14:02.250 --> 14:03.920
If you got something, hand it over.

14:05.080 --> 14:06.290
If you say so...

14:06.710 --> 14:10.500
It's a bunny figure of that game
character you said you like.

14:10.830 --> 14:12.920
You can't be serious!

14:13.380 --> 14:16.500
Why are all these girly figures in bunny outfits?

14:16.500 --> 14:17.500
They aren't!

14:17.500 --> 14:20.210
This figure just happens to be the bunny outfit version!

14:28.540 --> 14:30.330
That's wedding music...

14:30.330 --> 14:32.960
Oh, right! Umm...

14:32.960 --> 14:35.750
Happy birthday to you.

14:36.130 --> 14:39.380
Happy birthday to you.

14:39.380 --> 14:44.750
Happy birthday dear Kyo-chan

14:44.250 --> 14:49.210
<b>Happy Birthday</b>

14:45.080 --> 14:49.040
Happy birthday to you.

14:49.540 --> 14:52.500
Okay, make a wish for age 14 first!

14:53.750 --> 14:55.420
I hope I stay healthy...?

14:55.420 --> 14:56.710
Okay, grandpa.

14:59.960 --> 15:04.040
Happy birthday, Kyo.

15:06.670 --> 15:07.670
Kyo-chan?!

15:08.540 --> 15:10.330
There's been a murder!

15:10.750 --> 15:14.250
You can't just do that at a time like this!

15:15.000 --> 15:16.880
Ta-da! Whaddya think?

15:16.880 --> 15:18.080
You look cute!

15:18.080 --> 15:20.630
Really? Even in your model eyes?

15:20.630 --> 15:22.580
Very, very cute!

15:22.580 --> 15:25.960
Hang on, you're gonna say that
about everything, aren't you?

15:25.960 --> 15:28.170
Are they besties already?

15:28.540 --> 15:31.710
It's almost nine thirty. Will your parents worry?

15:31.710 --> 15:33.250
Maybe I should get going.

15:33.250 --> 15:35.880
Whaaat? Spend the night here!

15:36.670 --> 15:41.170
Momo and Hinako stayed over
the other night, so it's fine, right?

15:41.170 --> 15:44.040
So long as she's fine with it.

15:44.040 --> 15:45.210
See?

15:45.500 --> 15:46.750
Oh yeah...

15:52.130 --> 15:54.790
I-if I won't be a bother...

15:55.670 --> 15:56.830
This is bad...

15:57.210 --> 15:58.330
Real bad!

15:58.710 --> 16:00.290
Yeah. Do you mind?

16:00.290 --> 16:02.460
Are their parents okay with this?

16:04.830 --> 16:08.040
Hello, this is Ichikawa's mother.

16:08.040 --> 16:10.710
Sorry to trouble you so late at night.

16:10.710 --> 16:12.290
I'm sorry, "Ichikawa?"

16:12.290 --> 16:15.830
Our daughters just seem to be getting along so well.

16:15.830 --> 16:18.080
Yamada's gonna spend the night!

16:18.380 --> 16:22.000
But wait, my parents and my sister are still here.

16:22.000 --> 16:24.380
There's nothing bad about this.

16:24.710 --> 16:27.630
I'm going to let Yamada use the bath first.

16:28.500 --> 16:29.750
The bath!

16:29.750 --> 16:32.790
Come on, relax!
You're not going to be in there together.

16:32.790 --> 16:35.250
This is no different than when Kana's friends stay over.

16:35.250 --> 16:38.210
Yamada and Kana are just gonna
stay up all night together.

16:39.080 --> 16:44.080
Here, these sweats are for her pajamas.

16:44.330 --> 16:47.960
And I didn't have any brand new ones,

16:47.960 --> 16:50.080
so those are some
underwear I've only worn once.

16:50.880 --> 16:53.710
Quit acting like you just picked up a cockroach.

16:53.710 --> 16:56.750
You handle the rest...

16:56.750 --> 16:58.420
What? Hey!

17:00.630 --> 17:02.040
Seriously clocking out already?

17:08.880 --> 17:10.040
Uhh...

17:12.920 --> 17:14.000
I brought clothes.

17:14.000 --> 17:15.330
O-okay.

17:15.580 --> 17:19.080
These uhh, underwear are my sister's.

17:19.080 --> 17:20.580
You don't have to wear them.

17:20.790 --> 17:23.880
You can use the washing machine
if you want to wear your own.

17:25.000 --> 17:25.710
'Kay...

17:28.630 --> 17:29.630
I'll leave you be.

17:30.630 --> 17:31.750
Hey!

17:32.670 --> 17:34.290
Do you have a rubber?

17:35.500 --> 17:37.580
Sorry, I forgot mine.

17:37.580 --> 17:39.290
Did I leave it on the sink?

17:39.580 --> 17:40.920
The sink?

17:41.630 --> 17:43.500
Oh. A rubber BAND.

17:46.380 --> 17:47.830
I'll leave it here.

18:01.540 --> 18:04.250
S-somebody help...

18:06.540 --> 18:08.630
Sorry it's so cramped.

18:08.630 --> 18:10.040
No, thank you.

18:10.040 --> 18:11.830
I couldn't just not take a shower...
For the clothes, too.<b></b>

18:11.830 --> 18:13.630
I couldn't just not take a shower...

18:13.880 --> 18:16.670
But I didn't use her bathwater.

18:19.420 --> 18:23.080
And catching sight of my sister's
underwear was enough to cool my head.

18:24.880 --> 18:26.000
Water.

18:26.290 --> 18:28.080
I'm only here for some water.

18:29.040 --> 18:29.710
Hmm?

18:35.460 --> 18:36.420
<b>Delicious</b>

18:35.460 --> 18:36.420
<b>Amazake</b>

18:36.790 --> 18:38.500
Oh! Amazake!

18:38.500 --> 18:41.500
You only ate like two bites of dinner.

18:41.500 --> 18:42.920
Who, me?

18:42.920 --> 18:44.460
You sure were paying attention.

18:44.460 --> 18:45.830
No, I just...

18:46.500 --> 18:47.290
That some script?

18:47.290 --> 18:49.920
Yeah, we film in two days.

18:50.170 --> 18:52.460
Weren't you a little busy for this, then?

18:52.460 --> 18:55.960
No, I was just reading it 'cause I couldn't sleep.

19:03.750 --> 19:04.420
Is it for a movie?

19:04.420 --> 19:05.210
Yeah!

19:05.500 --> 19:10.330
It's about a girl in her rebellious stage who
lashes out at her parents, but it's so hard...

19:10.540 --> 19:13.750
Everything will be ruined if I don't get it right, though.

19:13.750 --> 19:16.460
M-must be nerve-wracking.

19:16.830 --> 19:18.710
What a lame comment...

19:19.250 --> 19:21.920
I never had a rebellious phase, see?

19:22.330 --> 19:23.790
Must be nice.

19:23.790 --> 19:27.500
What? Have you, I-Ichikawa?

19:28.000 --> 19:29.630
Isn't it obvious?

19:29.920 --> 19:33.330
Why? You have such nice parents.

19:33.330 --> 19:35.380
H-how should I know?

19:36.500 --> 19:39.710
But, it's not like I'm mad at them.

19:39.710 --> 19:42.500
I'm mostly mad at not letting myself be me.

19:43.210 --> 19:46.540
Worried that I'm not a good kid.

19:49.330 --> 19:50.790
What am I even saying?

19:53.420 --> 19:55.580
That probably doesn't really help—

20:10.460 --> 20:11.630
What is this feeling?

20:12.130 --> 20:14.750
My heart is racing but I feel so at ease.

20:15.580 --> 20:17.080
<b>We...</b>

20:17.380 --> 20:20.130
There's something so strange about her.

20:21.130 --> 20:23.080
<b>...Stayed Up All Night</b>

20:27.080 --> 20:28.080
Thanks...

20:28.500 --> 20:30.670
I'm excited to play the part, now.

20:35.170 --> 20:37.040
<b>We Stayed Up All Night</b>

20:37.210 --> 20:40.540
And then Kana joined a band
'cause she wanted to be popular...

21:14.380 --> 21:15.580
G'night.

22:52.540 --> 22:53.540
Wait a minute...

22:54.000 --> 22:56.540
Kana's underwear went unused...

22:57.330 --> 22:59.210
And the washing machine was running...

23:01.750 --> 23:03.920
Yamada's not wearing any—
